14	 * of the key, two members of the same household (same householdId) with different telephones
15	 * have different keys and are both allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate.
16	 *
17	 * <p>Lives beside {@link Owner} so both the mapping layer (which returns the key) and the
18	 * request-handling layer (which dedups on it) can depend on it without a package cycle.
19	 */
